OL,3,ADemocrats take control of US Congress
OL,4,Aas voters reject Trump's Republicans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,7,FHouse, taking control of Congress for
OL,8,Fthe rest of Donald Trump's presidency
OL,10,FThrough the night, the Democrats pick
OL,11,Fup a string of surprise victories in
OL,12,FRepublican strongholds, including
OL,13,FTexas, Kansas and Ohio
OL,15,FIn his first comments, Trump writes on
OL,16,Fsocial media: "I wasn't on the ballot
OL,17,Fand if I was, we would have won in a
OL,18,Flandslide!"
